Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.69,0:01:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.93,0:01:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way in the tumble waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.31,0:01:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.61,0:01:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is what I am for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I've traveled far\Nfrom where my search began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over streets of green and shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the endless\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.83,0:01:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some days from where I'll finally see\Nthe light I will search for everywhere?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.11,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2.4\c&H0D0501&\3c&H0D0501&\blur0.6\fad(684,0)\1a&HFF&\t(604,684,\1a&H00&)}Divine Reckoning
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.11,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFAF9F9&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(684,0)}Divine Reckoning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.85,0:01:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's actually a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:02:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he lives on an island up here\Nthat no one's allowed to walk on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that everyone noticed the\Nbig sign that said Godland Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means this land is ruled\Nby the almighty God, Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God's name is Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows and sees everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's truly omniscient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He keeps his all-seeing eyes\Nfocused on everyone. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real? Like right now? Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.43,0:02:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get over the size of those trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they do have earth and ground up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.35,0:02:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A place we're not allowed to\Ngo to no matter what, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen that look in your eyes before,\NLuffy, and it always gets us into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the lady says we can't go there\Nbecause it's sacred or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what she means.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:03:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not letting you drag\Nme down with you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand we're not\Nsupposed to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think I'm the kind\Nof guy who would do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.93,0:03:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this guy is God, then shouldn't\Nhe forgive you no matter what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walking around on some forbidden island\Ndoesn't seem like a big deal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breaking any law set forth by our\NAlmighty is nothing less than sacrilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't matter either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd go even if it meant\Nhe'd die in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go and find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't care about saving Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just want to satisfy\Nyour twisted urns to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do the exact opposite of\Nwhat you've been told.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the biggest\Ntrees I've ever seen in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.01,0:03:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my life they've got to\Nbe hundreds of years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That or things grow bigger\Na few miles up in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're so tall I can't\Neven see where they top out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy we gotta get going oh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fine don't listen to me but
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're gonna feel awful if\Nsomething bad happens to Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while you're busy stuffing your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The food will be here when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conis, I know this guy, and I could\Nbe here all day waiting on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me how to\Nget to the upper yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta go help Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About Nami, she might just be out in the\Nclouds and nowhere near the upper yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain how devastating it could\Nbe to us to incur the wrath of our god,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, he took my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those voices, those\Nsounds, what were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This boy is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't look like you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.05,0:06:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me I\Ndon't want to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, so this is your old waver, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take better care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to take a look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assuming it's fixable, I should\Nbe able to do that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.71,0:06:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an engineer that specializes\Nin dialed ships, so I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:07:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.55,0:07:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You down there, help please give me a ride
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please you want a ride\Nbut this is a one person
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boat Please help me oh\NI can't there's no room
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.69,0:07:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either give me the boat\Nor I'll slice you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorilla
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this Aniru's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you, Hartford!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.15,0:08:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.39,0:09:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get some water tiles down here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fire's spreading!
