Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the white berets doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, something must have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.65,0:09:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are all warned to use extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've received word that\Nillegal entrants have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,infiltrated Skypiea\Nthrough Angel Beach today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are reportedly seven suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do not worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can help with our search and investigation\Nby reporting all suspicious activity?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to the white berets!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,White berets!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appeared as if he was\Ntalking to someone in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was probably delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would someone please shut that dog up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.55,0:10:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was most likely begging for his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did Enel take care\Nof that guy himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that why he sent us\Nhere in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.01,0:10:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We probably ran out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ran out of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet another group of illegal entrants\Nhas already infiltrated Skypiea again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old lady Amazon informed us that it's a\Nship with seven blue sea dwellers on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven blue sea dwellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's probably us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here illegally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you wish to\Nproceed you must first pay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the entrance fee of one\Nbillion extra per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we didn't pay the entrance fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven heads looks like one\Nof us is gonna have to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is happening on this\Nisland and who are those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get back to\Nthe others to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope I get to them\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat this one, Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that'll be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cloud sculpture's so good,\Nit should be in a museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the worst-looking\Nart I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen parts like these before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, just fix it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but until I have a\Nchance to look at this closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you at least try?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like we have company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, on the beach, don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he mean us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, why are they crawling? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, they've obviously got issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they're crawling\Naround like crabs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight for rays!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House! House!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House, gentlemen. So, so!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak our language, we can't understand\Nyou! What are they? Soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Sam said they have issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look what we have here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be the Blue Sea-dwellers who have
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,illegally entered the\Nsovereign land of Skypiea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to have the weight of Heaven's\Njudgment brought down upon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're calling them criminals?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Illegal entry? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your breath making excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazon, the woman who\Nstands at Heaven's Gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,captured these very images\Nusing her vision dial! No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this is all a big\Nmisunderstanding, Captain McKinley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not the criminals\Nyou're making them out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.51,0:13:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by illegal entry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this have to do with that\Nridiculous $1 billion extol entrance fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we didn't pay her a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But didn't that old lady say\Nwe didn't have to pay it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like she tried to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no sense trying\Nto deny it! Now fuss up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.55,0:13:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you need not\Nbecome panicked just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to Heaven's Judgment, illegal\Nentry is only an eleventh-degree crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you accept your punishment,\Nwhich will be minimal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you become legal tourist on the\Nspot and may go about your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you should have told us that sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before we accept, what exactly do\Nyou have planned as far as punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mere slap on the wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is pay\Nten times the entrance fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:14:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you pay immediately, we'll\Npretend this little episode never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.03,0:14:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10 billion per person times seven people\Nmakes your total 70 billion extols,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cash only.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, 70 billion extols?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like an awful lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much is that in berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the currency used in\Nthe blue sea world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's exchange rates are\N10,000 extols per berry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, now there's 10,000\Nand you gotta carry the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.11,0:14:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a decimal in there? Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,70 billion extols is 7\Nmillion berries, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get real!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how expensive that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After risking our lives\Ncoming to this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why should we have to pay a stupid\Nfee just to enter your precious city?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't agree to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brought this on yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had just paid the 700,000\Nberries in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be having this talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's still way too expensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your first warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The White Berets serve under\Nthe vassals of Almighty Inneru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arguing with us will only\Nraise the level of your crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, whatever, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's forget these idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to start looking for Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may need my tender\Naffections right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't care about the right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those weird guys from earlier somehow\Nknew about us coming to Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means Luffy and the\Nothers may be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better hurry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to ride this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This waiver looks downright abused.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I find out you're\Nresponsible for this damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're looking at a tenth degree crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.53,0:15:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destruction of Sky Island\Nproperty by a Blue Sea dweller.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Captain McKinley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I crashed the waiver, not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, besides, this thing's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds suspicious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression waivers\Ndidn't exist in the Blue Sea World.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this one was stolen from Skypiea,\Nthe degree of your crime will increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, there's a whole group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they're not those guys from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever they are, I hope Luffy's\Nnot pulling any of his usual stunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.23,0:16:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sit down and take a breather, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Luffy, Chopper, there's\Nno reason for us to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.93,0:16:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.95,0:16:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.61,0:16:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise you won't start any trouble, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know if I can keep that promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you to fork up\Nseven million berries
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from your stash to pay\Nfor all the fines we got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we pay the fine and we're clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he say seven million?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:16:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so worked up, I\Nforgot to hit the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks for letting\Nme use your waiver.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the way it handles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.95,0:17:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you enjoyed it,\Nbut more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you realize how much\Ntrouble you're in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, let's make ourselves scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to finish\Nthe fight you just started?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, this Enel is not\Nsomeone we want to mess with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And knocking out an official\Nis a crime of the fifth degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you're found guilty of\Ncommitting a fifth degree crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almighty Enel will banish you to\Nthe land of the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Land of the drifting clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a death sentence. You die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll put you and your\Nship on a small cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And set you adrift in the sea with\Nno chance of rescue or escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.55,0:17:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll eventually die a\Nvery slow and painful death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting that must be why we\Nsaw that ship fall from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember that\Ngalleon we saw falling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The saint bris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was called.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know that crew could\Nhave been punished over 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.93,0:18:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you scum know what\Nyou've done to our captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, let me handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.31,0:18:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take it so personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a lucky shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lucky shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Completely unintentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.65,0:18:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you blame a beginner for messing\Nup and nearly killing your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seemed like you had a\Npretty good handle on it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's trying to trick them\Ninto thinking it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't blow it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.99,0:18:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, as important\Nas your investigation is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps it would be best to get\Nthe captain to a doctor first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, the captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.55,0:18:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, there's no reason to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take him to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get right on that. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider yourselves\Nunder preliminary arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they crawling again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't they just carry\Nthem like normal people?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys saved my life, so I know\Nyou're not as bad as they claim you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So take this chance and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'd better take her advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was on the waiver, I saw it for\Nmyself: an island filled with monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you You did exactly what\Neveryone was hoping you wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the place we were\Ntold to never ever set foot on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give him any ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to get excited about, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need is\Nto get involved with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it'll break my heart\Nto be away from Conis,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.67,0:19:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if that's what Nami wants, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stick around any longer, Conis and\NPakeya may get in trouble because of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:19:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those white berets will charge\Nthem as our accomplices.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.53,0:20:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can escape now on our own, then it\Nshouldn't cause them any trouble, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, how can they be helping\Nus when they're with that captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's the plan. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.01,0:20:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever arrests them is an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.63,0:20:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.73,0:20:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Blue Sea Dwellers will never escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you two argue on the boat? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staying here equals more\Ntrouble for everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.67,0:20:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say anything to\Ndefend these criminals,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will consider you and\Nyour father accomplices.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:21:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people must be punished\Nto the full extent of the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,law for all the abusive language\Nand deplorable violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.35,0:21:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find them guilty of fifth-degree crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of almighty Inaru, you are\Nbanished to drift into clouds for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.41,0:21:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harass them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just run, you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire the milky arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Nami, run, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.49,0:21:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.69,0:21:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Viper Rays, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool trick, mind if I try?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.89,0:22:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you see his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.97,0:22:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's all stretchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.23,0:22:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away, Devil Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.01,0:22:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.09,0:23:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.65,0:23:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, how's the money situation looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,50,000 berries left!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,50,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.75,0:23:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were that broke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.15,0:23:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, that'd last\Nus a day or two at most!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.97,0:23:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we so poor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.21,0:23:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.39,0:23:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your captain has something to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.03,0:23:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone on my ship needs to be\Nmore good with money from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.23,0:23:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So lead by example! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.03,0:23:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, in any case, the Fighting Formation\NB I taught them to use was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.50,0:23:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.42,0:23:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They defeated the White Berets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this altitude, the athletic ability\Nof Blue Sea-Dwellers usually decreases.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.99,0:23:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those poor deluded fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.01,0:23:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, criminals, you\Nhave no chance of escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.23,0:23:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have behaved and\Ndone what I told you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.01,0:23:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all of the upholders\Nof law here at Skypiea,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.83,0:24:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we white parades are the most lenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.63,0:24:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, they are not nearly as forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.77,0:24:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.13,0:24:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are now considered\Nsecond-degree criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.51,0:24:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can try to cry for mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.75,0:24:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you will all be judged?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.67,0:24:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the priests of Upper Yard! House!

